      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "没有足球课了",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-08-no-more-football-classes_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "你那个校内足球课好像没有了！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-08-no-more-football-classes_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "什么意思？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-08-no-more-football-classes_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "课表里面，校内课只有一个篮球课，校外足球课只对一年级开放。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-08-no-more-football-classes_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "估计报不了足球了，要不只能报校内篮球了？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-08-no-more-football-classes_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我不喜欢篮球。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-08-no-more-football-classes_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "那你不报也不行。你要报一个运动啊，不然你的眼睛受不了的。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-08-no-more-football-classes_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        }
      ]
    },
